WEBVTT

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:05.140
Sion... remember this.

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:13.400
It doesn't matter who speaks poorly of you,

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:18.880
because you'll find plenty of people who will love you.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:22.360
So, even if I'm not there,

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.610
you're not alone.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.210
Sion!

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:34.260
Well? How are things going for Ryner's group?

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.600
There's a dumb prince and a good prince.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.400
Nobody likes the dumb prince.

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:49.350
Everybody likes the good prince the most!

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:51.780
Toale Nelphi.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:54.930
And the wild beast said that Toale's dessert was so delicious,

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:58.740
he'd just sleep off his full stomach!

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:00.680
Is that so?

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:05.190
Ryner and Ferris are at Toale's place, aren't they?

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:06.110
Yup!

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:09.010
Nelpha, huh?

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:49.280
But, rumors of a visit to Nelpha are spreading throughout the nation.

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:52.560
That's obviously a ploy by Duke Stearied's faction.

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:54.400
It's clearly a trap!

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.620
Not one you should walk into. Just call it off.

00:02:57.620 --> 00:02:59.600
Nelpha is a place you should visit, Your Majesty.

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:06.150
What do you mean by that, Colonel Froaude?

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:09.700
The foolish nobles have set up a foul trap.

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:13.530
Given that, you must overcome it without a problem, Your Majesty.

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:18.570
If we handle this correctly, we could use this chance to round up the entire anti-royalist faction.

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:21.510
If Sion gets killed, it's all over!

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:24.060
The anti-royalist faction has joined forces with the Nelphan nobility,

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:26.670
and they're conspiring to have Sion murdered!

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:30.220
Even if His Majesty heads for Nelpha, he would not die.

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:32.480
What makes you so confident of that?

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:36.170
I will act jointly with His Majesty, and enter Nelpha.

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.950
And what would happen if <i>you</i> were the hired killer?

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:44.970
If I were, all you'd have to do is kill me and protect His Majesty.

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:49.520
Or, do you lack the confidence to do so, Rear Admiral Klom?

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:54.460
If I had reason to suspect that Sion might die at your hands while in Nelpha,

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:57.300
I'd kill you right here, right now.

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:01.970
Your Majesty.

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:03.740
Please, make your choice.

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:10.260
I'll head to Nelpha. Froaude will be the only one to accompany me.

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:24.120
has now arrived!

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:34.870
Don't tell me he plans to invade Nelpha?

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:37.130
If Roland were to invade, in our current state,

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:39.050
Nelpha would be helpless against it!

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:48.030
It is a pleasure to meet you in person, King of Nelpha.

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:51.820
I cannot convey the gratitude I feel for your kind reception of this sudden visit.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:57.330
I-I beg your pardon. I am Gread Nelphi, King of Nelpha.

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:04.670
I wished to seek after your wisdom, Lord Nelphi, as you are one who has long reigned as a wise ruler.

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:08.070
Thus, I have humbly made my journey here.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:10.390
You have quite a way with words.

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:11.260
Not at all.

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:14.960
If it could be done, I wish for my Roland Empire

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:18.730
to enjoy a long period of fellowship with Imperial Nelpha.

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:20.460
Lord Astal...

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.420
You're awfully young, aren't you?

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:29.980
Roland's hardly a kingdom fit for such things!

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:32.480
P-Prince Starnel! How can you say such things?

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:34.810
Who do you think you're talking to? I'll kill you.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:36.160
Starnel!

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:42.470
I am Sion Astal, King of the Roland Empire.

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:43.860
It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:48.180
Don't put on airs with me just because you've become king of some backwoods country—

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:50.080
What's the big idea, old man?!

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.940
Silence, you foolish son! Leave!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.360
I must apologize. He has shamed me deeply.

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:04.180
I truly apologize for my son's rudeness—

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:05.850
Please, do not worry.

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:09.760
It is true that I am a young king with no power.

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:12.960
Regardless of how your son put it, I cannot deny it.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:18.280
Tomorrow night, I wish to hold a grand banquet of welcome for you.

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:20.380
May I trust that you will attend?

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.510
It would be my pleasure to accept.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:29.260
<i>Lord Astal, the King, is incredible.</i>

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:32.550
<i>He deals with commoners like me on equal terms.</i>

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:35.250
<i>He truly puts this kingdom first in his heart.</i>

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:40.210
You still have that letter with you?

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:43.150
Yes. I'll deliver it as soon as I return home.

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:46.550
You saw the figurehead propped up there, didn't you?

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.380
Starnel Nelphi...

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.970
Who's the one pulling his strings?

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:53.390
They'll be identified soon enough, I'm sure.

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:56.410
The people I'm using are first-rate.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:59.320
And you are also first-rate. Is that what you're implying?

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:03.490
I am devoted only to you, Your Majesty.

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:05.400
I shall protect you, whatever happens.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.560
That's quite encouraging to hear.

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:09.120
There's a place I wish to visit.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:11.930
Take care of the rest.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:13.700
Surely, you jest?

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:17.720
I'm not the kind of king who would die in a place such as this, remember?

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:22.090
Understood. Please, leave the rest to me.

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:40.860
Hey, Ryner. Long time no see. Have you been doing your job?

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:43.610
I'm going back to sleep—

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:48.690
No matter how hungry you are, desks aren't edible, you know.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:52.220
I'm not eating it! Say, why'd you kick me, anyway?!

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:55.030
My way was blocked. I merely pushed you along.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.370
That's not what a kick is!

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:59.220
How nice, you seem to be getting along well.

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:01.120
"Getting along"? Shut up!

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:04.740
Say, Sion, what's the big idea, pushing this annoying woman onto me—

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:08.750
I'm dying! I'm going to die from this!

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.810
You really do get along well.

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:14.530
Ferris was nowhere near as unreserved around me.

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:21.380
Do you know the meaning of the word "mercy"?

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:25.400
Why do I get beaten to the verge of death just for one harmless morning joke?

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.320
Delicious!

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:28.690
I'll kill you...

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:30.240
I swear, I'll kill you one day.

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:32.880
But, if I can't get Ferris, maybe Sion...

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:35.830
Thanks for waiting.

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:39.960
So, you said you were Ryner's cousin, Sion?

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:43.580
What are you talking about, Toale? This guy's Roland's—

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:45.670
We're cousins, aren't we?

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:48.160
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:49.760
<i>Take a hint.</i>

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:52.170
Yes! That's it exactly.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:57.090
I can't take this. I'm taking an afternoon nap.

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:59.150
Aren't you always sleeping?

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:02.290
I really wish I could sleep all day.

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:08.170
With all the women you attack on the streets at night, it's no wonder you'd be so tired.

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:09.130
Is that true?

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:10.200
It's not!

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:13.670
The three of you all get along so well, don't you?

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:15.280
Who does?!

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:19.970
Toale, I understand you carry the blood of this nation's royal family?

00:09:19.970 --> 00:09:22.450
It's nothing so glamorous.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:26.650
Your father is Prince Starnel Nelphi, am I correct?

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:31.160
Yes, but to my father, I'm just a burden.

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:34.300
But I hear that you excel in academics,

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:39.860
and that the cabinet ministers secretly consult with you behind the Prince's back.

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:44.060
If I can see to it that my younger siblings are raised happy,

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.480
that's enough for me.

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:53.450
It's too bad. I bet Toale would make a way better king than someone like you.

00:09:58.060 --> 00:10:01.990
Besides, what are you even doing here?!

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:04.060
I just happened to be in the neighborhood.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:05.770
Quit lying!

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:07.360
Well, on that note...

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:08.410
What is it?

00:10:09.240 --> 00:10:11.120
I have a favor to ask the two of you.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:12.740
Wh...

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:58.470
Man, I'm tired.

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:02.940
Say, why are we going through all this hassle for Sion, anyway?

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.520
He said that if we didn't guard him,

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.980
he'd crush the Wynnit dumpling shop.

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:13.030
Aren't you concerned for Sion's life?

00:11:13.030 --> 00:11:14.400
Is that necessary?

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:16.120
Guess not.

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:18.650
Is there someone on the roof?

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:19.490
Careful.

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:34.160
Thank you for waiting, Your Majesty.

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:39.850
Let's hear your report.

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:44.990
Count Werius. He is one of the ringleaders in this affair.

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:48.410
And? Who's in charge?

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:50.260
It's Prince Starnel.

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:53.080
It seems that the matter took root

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:56.710
when the King began seriously considering designating Toale Nelphi as his successor.

00:11:56.710 --> 00:12:00.140
That implies that he seeks to assassinate his father before that happens,

00:12:00.140 --> 00:12:02.870
and secure his place on the throne, yes?

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:09.250
Yes. He turned shamelessly to the nobles of Roland for support.

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:15.820
Would you truly have me conquer the entire continent of Menoris?

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:21.310
A true king is not what one desires to be, but what the world desires of one.

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:25.270
I shall speak with the King of Nelpha.

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:28.170
Let him handle Prince Starnel's punishment.

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:29.720
As you command.

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:42.360
What a beautiful moonlit night.

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:44.760
All of you, have a pleasant rest.

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:50.340
Now, most of the Nelphan collaborators have been disposed of.

00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:52.120
Then, all that's left is...

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:03.760
Ferris.

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:20.240
I'm impressed that you noticed my presence, Lord Toale Nelphi.

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:27.860
But there was nothing reported in your background about being skilled in combat.

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:29.950
And who might you be?

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:34.870
Oh, I beg your pardon. My name is Miran Froaude.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.720
Miran Froaude?

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:42.550
The citizens of this land believe you should become their king, Lord Toale.

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:44.880
But it would be a problem

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:49.690
for this land to be blessed with a good king, and establish a position of power.

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:52.940
For that reason, Toale Nelphi, please die.

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:56.220
Let there be...

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:58.100
Darkness!

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:06.050
Hey, Ryner. What is this?

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:10.450
It's not magic.

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:13.150
Even the Alpha Stigma can't make out any structure.

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:14.830
Let there be darkness!

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.190
Ferris, incoming!

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:18.500
Do it, Ryner!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.510
Got it.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:24.900
I offer up this contract, to bear the wicked spirit beast which sleeps in the earth!

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:27.950
Magic from the Kingdom of Estabul?

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:34.320
What I seek is the burning field. Crimson!

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.990
Now he's using Roland magic?

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:38.680
Let there be darkness!

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:49.090
I see. You're not Lord Toale.

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:51.630
You're a guard of his, aren't you?

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:54.100
You seem to be a dangerous person as well.

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:57.260
And that swordswoman's moves were far from ordinary.

00:14:58.220 --> 00:15:01.720
For him to have gathered this much talent,

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:05.150
it only confirms that Toale Nelphi must be disposed of.

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:11.200
Ferris!

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:27.340
What I seek is thunder. Izuchi!

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:36.750
Ferris?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:43.860
Ferris!

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:46.510
She's finished.

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:50.740
In the end, all the weak can do is prostrate themselves before the strong.

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:54.650
You're calling Ferris weak? You're full of crap.

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:59.670
That woman isn't the kind to fall over clumsily onto the ground.

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:03.120
She's always strong, and always acts all high and mighty.

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:05.440
If she didn't... If she didn't...

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:08.150
It'd mean that I'd lose the chance to get beaten up all the time!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:11.550
Then, what will you do to me?

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:13.670
Beat the crap out of you and make that shadow disappear.

00:16:13.670 --> 00:16:15.830
You cannot do it.

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:17.910
There's no telling until I try.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:21.080
You control the shadows with that ring, don't you?

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:25.100
You are truly a frightening person.

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:26.600
How could you tell?

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:30.920
I remembered the legend of the Great Emperor Kokuei.

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.670
The legend of the Shadow King who cast the world into the shadows.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:39.800
That king bestowed upon his chief subordinate a ring imbued with a strange power.

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:42.650
It was the power to control shadows.

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:45.490
That subordinate used the ring's power

00:16:45.490 --> 00:16:48.670
to assassinate leading members of enemy nations, but

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:53.030
a certain knight cut off the finger that bore the ring with a sword.

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:57.450
The name of that knight, that legendary hero, was...

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.010
That's right, Halford Miran.

00:17:00.530 --> 00:17:04.550
Halford Miran sliced off the finger of the shadow-controlling assassin,

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:06.660
and repelled the ring's power.

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:08.900
You cannot do it.

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:11.420
Yeah, it might be impossible for me.

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:12.630
But, maybe Ferris—

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:17.590
If you've got the time to explain all that, find this man's weakness already.

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:21.690
It's that ring! That ring creates shadow monsters.

00:17:21.690 --> 00:17:25.320
So, if we both focus on that ring, we should be able to crush him!

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:31.060
The ring? So, in other words, that ring is a hero's relic?

00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:31.790
Yes!

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:35.450
Then, with a hero's relic right before us,

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.630
what are you doing lying around like an idiot?

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:39.800
Huh? You're the one who—

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:42.460
Sorry. My hand slipped.

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:44.340
You're such a...

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:48.870
Oh, whatever. Let's just crush this guy already.

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:56.460
You two are quite amusing! It's truly a pity I have to kill you.

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:58.460
But, if I allowed you to live,

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:04.510
you would certainly pose a hindrance to my master one day.

00:18:04.510 --> 00:18:05.500
Your master?

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:10.290
Please, be at ease. I will not harm Lord Toale.

00:18:10.290 --> 00:18:14.580
After all, I have a much graver matter to deal with: killing the two of you.

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:19.240
Then, let us meet again soon.

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:26.900
If that bluff just now hadn't worked, things could've gotten worse.

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:35.040
You've had a rough day. I'll take care of the rest, so get some sleep.

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:39.650
If you're thinking of assaulting me in my sleep...

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:41.290
I'm not going to assault you!

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:57.230
I can't discern that man's character at all.

00:18:57.230 --> 00:19:02.680
None of my seekers have turned up any information about him from before he was adopted into Duke Froaude's house.

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:04.740
Everyone involved has been killed.

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:08.640
As for the nobles who plotted your assassination in Nelpha,

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:10.790
didn't he murder them all?

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:11.550
Yes.

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:14.550
He's too dangerous. You should remove him immediately.

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:19.440
It's Miran Froaude.

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:23.330
I have brought an additional report from the visit to Nelpha.

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:24.120
Enter.

00:19:34.490 --> 00:19:37.770
What did you discover of my background?

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:40.350
Would you like to see for yourself?

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.320
You've done quite some research here.

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:52.790
What do you plan to do? Will you dismiss me?

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:56.330
You did amazing work for me in Nelpha.

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:58.710
Why would I need to dismiss you?

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:01.410
You are certainly a strange person.

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:03.500
I hardly need to hear that from you.

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:08.140
In your shoes, I would just as quickly eliminate such a person of dangerous talent.

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:11.460
I believe in utilizing whatever can be utilized.

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:14.380
That caliber is what qualifies you as king.

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:18.790
As long as you desire it, I shall serve you.

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:21.770
So, what is this additional report?

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:26.620
I attacked the residence of Toale Nelphi, the King's grandson,

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:28.660
but there was unexpected interference.

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:36.620
Froaude and Ryner's group fought against one another?

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:42.420
Does that mean that I indirectly attempted to kill Ryner and Ferris?

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:47.570
Ridiculous. I would never make such a blunder.

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:49.370
There's no problem.

00:20:56.220 --> 00:20:57.330
Come on.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:20:58.540
Right...

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:03.760
If we stick around, that Froaude guy might come back again, right?

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:04.670
Ryner.

00:21:05.710 --> 00:21:09.760
My back injury has gotten better. It shouldn't be a hindrance after this.

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:14.760
Although without your crude care, it might have healed a bit faster.

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:17.050
You are such a...

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:24.960
I see. Good for you.

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:29.820
Well, let's get going, wherever.

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:36.660
Have you seen a beautiful, violent woman and a black-haired man?

00:21:37.910 --> 00:21:39.700
Thank you very much!

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:48.360
<i>Ryner, I'll be sure to find you!</i>

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:25.120
<i>I keep saying that searching for hero's relics is a huge bother!</i>

00:23:25.120 --> 00:23:28.460
<i>What is it this time? Pursuit? Taboo breaking?</i>

00:23:28.460 --> 00:23:30.120
<i>I've got no idea what that means.</i>

00:23:30.120 --> 00:23:32.420
<i>I'll just dump all of them and go home! Jeez.</i>

00:23:32.420 --> 00:23:34.480
<i>Ugh, this really sucks!</i>
